## Key Design Decisions

| Aspect | HRM Checking (old) | EDU Checking (new) |
|---|---|---|
| Storage | Offline-first (Hive) | Online-first (API) |
| Sync | Background Workmanager | Direct API call |
| Context | Shift-based (morning/afternoon/night) | Session-based (specific course + time) |
| Late detection | Based on local shift times | Backend calculates based on session window |
| Entity | `CheckInOut` (Hive) | `EduCheckIn` (UI-only) + `ManualCheckinResult` (API) |
| Face recognition | Same | Same (reuses `FaceNative`) |

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The existing HRM checking files (`lib/pages/checking/*`) are **not modified**. The new EDU checking flow is a completely separate module.

